g and laugh"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Let yourself be carried away by my lightness"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "In this world sometimes too serious"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "I'm here to make you laugh, that's my wish"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}